{"unit_id": "tag:01NA:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为一个分次环（graded ring），作为<MATH_0002>-代数（algebra）由<MATH_0003>的元素（elements）生成。在这种情形下，概形（scheme）<MATH_0004>表示如下函子（functor）：它为概形（scheme）<MATH_0005>赋予一个集合（set），其成员为二元组（pairs）<MATH_0006>，其中\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0007>是可逆（invertible）的<MATH_0008>-模（module），且\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0009>是分次环（graded ring）同态（homomorphism），使得<MATH_0010>由全局截面（global sections）<MATH_0011>生成，其中<MATH_0012>\n<STRUCT_0004>\n这些二元组按上述严格（strict）等价（equivalence）视为相同。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "全局截面"}, {"source_term": "strict", "target_term": "严格"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "描述引理所设的环。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "描述该环在生成条件中的代数结构。"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素", "context": "指生成该代数的元素。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指表示该函子的对象。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "指由该概形表示的函子。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指该函子的输入对象。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指该函子赋予输入对象的集合。"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "二元组", "context": "指集合中按给定等价关系理解的二元组。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "限定二元组中的模。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指出二元组中可逆对象的类型。"}, {"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "指同态所涉及的环结构。"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态", "context": "指出二元组中映射的类型。"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "全局截面", "context": "指满足生成条件的一组截面。"}, {"source_term": "strict", "target_term": "严格", "context": "限定上文所述的等价。"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价", "context": "指判定二元组何时视为相同的关系。"}], "notes": []}
